From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:45:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] core: delete the Unix and Windows console drivers

ConsoleManager probes for a Windows console first and then for a Unix tty.
Neither exists on Android: there is no console to allocate and /dev/tty is not
reachable from an app process. Both drivers P/Invoke into APIs that are absent
there, so they are deleted rather than left to fail at probe time. The Android
driver added earlier becomes the only implementation, together with the
ConsoleWriter helper the Windows driver needed.
